
<#
.SYNOPSIS
    This PowerShell script ensures that the Windows 11
    minimum password length is configured to at least
    14 characters.

.NOTES
    Author          : Sinjin Torga-Eide
    LinkedIn        : https://www.linkedin.com/in/sinjin-torga-eide-674185297
    GitHub          : https://github.com/DatGuy84
    Date Created    : 2026-11-17
    Version         : 1.0
    CVEs            : N/A
    Plugin IDs      : N/A
    STIG-ID         : WN11-AC-000035
    Vulnerability ID: V-253303
    Severity        : Medium (CAT II)
    Documentation   : https://stigaview.com/products/win11/v2r8/WN11-AC-000035/

.TESTED ON
    Date(s) Tested  : 2026-11-17
    Tested By       : Sinjin Torga-Eide
    Systems Tested  : Windows 11 VM (intended)
    PowerShell Ver. : 5.1

.USAGE
    Run PowerShell as Administrator.

    Example:
    PS C:\> .\WN11-AC-000035.ps1

    This script configures the minimum password length
    to 14 characters and verifies the configuration.
#>

# STIG WN11-AC-000035 Remediation

# Configure minimum password length to 14 characters
net accounts /minpwlen:14

# Verify minimum password length policy
net accounts
